    "account_topology": {
        "_comment": "Story 25.7 stitch: TikTok topology is a single flat level -- the token's reachable ADVERTISERS (ad accounts). The selected reporting entity is the ADVERTISER (pulls target /report/integrated/get with advertiser_id). discover_accounts lists what the token can reach via oauth2/advertiser/get. Replaces the TIKTOK_ADS_ADVERTISER_ID env-var pattern (deprecated, removed at 25.7 rollout -- see catalog_sources/ROLLOUT_NOTES.md). Additive per AD-2: core reads levels/selection_level/discovery generically, never TikTok vocabulary.",
        "levels": [
